{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"何西阿書","commonName":"何西阿書","title":"何西阿書","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"1390c0b166f5f648615cbddd0fc0981a1b1280f32e03791ade9afbe66f074180","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":10,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以色列是茂盛的葡萄樹，碩果纍纍。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可是，他結果越多，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"建造的祭壇就越多；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"土地出產越豐富，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他就把神柱裝飾得越美麗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們心懷詭詐，必受懲罰。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華要拆毀他們的祭壇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打碎他們的神柱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時他們會說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我們沒有君王，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為我們不敬畏耶和華。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"君王能為我們做什麼呢？」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們說虛話，起假誓，立空盟，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此不法之事滋長，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶如田間犁溝中蔓延的毒草。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撒瑪利亞的居民要因伯·亞文的牛犢偶像而驚恐；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祭拜它的人要哀傷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"供奉它的祭司要痛哭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為它的榮耀將離開他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它要被帶到亞述去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"作為貢物獻給強大的亞述王。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮因此而受人嘲笑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列因自己的偶像而蒙羞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撒瑪利亞和它的君王要被毀滅，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像漂浮在水面上的枯枝一樣消逝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列犯罪之地——亞文","poem":1},{"noteId":17},{"text":"的邱壇要被拆毀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的祭壇上要長滿荊棘和蒺藜。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要向高山說：「遮蓋我們吧！」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"對小丘說：「倒在我們身上吧！」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「以色列人啊，從基比亞的日子以來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們一直不斷地犯罪，從未改變。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道戰禍沒有臨到基比亞的邪惡之輩嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要按自己的心意懲罰你們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列國要聯合攻擊你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"懲罰你們的雙重罪惡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法蓮本是馴服的母牛犢，喜歡打穀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在我要把軛套在牠肥美的頸項上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要駕馭以法蓮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大必耕田，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各","poem":1},{"noteId":18},{"text":"必耙地。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"你們要為自己種植公義，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就能收穫慈愛。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"現在是尋求耶和華的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要犁開剛硬的心田，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"等祂來使公義如雨澆灌你們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"可是，你們種的是邪惡，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"收的是不義，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃的是謊言的果實。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你們倚靠自己的力量，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仰仗眾多的勇士。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，戰爭的喧囂將從你們中間傳出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的一切堡壘將被摧毀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"恰如沙勒幔在戰爭之日摧毀伯·亞比勒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將城中的母子一同摔死。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"伯特利","poem":1},{"noteId":19},{"text":"啊，你罪大惡極，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必遭遇同樣的下場。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那日來臨時，以色列的王將被徹底消滅。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":17,"caller":"+","text":"「亞文」指伯·亞文，伯·亞文的意思見本卷書4·15節註腳。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":8}},{"noteId":18,"caller":"+","text":"「雅各」在舊約中常與「以色列」互換使用，有時指以色列人的先祖雅各，有時指以色列民族。本節的以法蓮和雅各都代指北國以色列。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":11}},{"noteId":19,"caller":"+","text":"「伯特利」此處代指以色列人。","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":15}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/10.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/11.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}